891
00:33:07,124 --> 00:33:08,245
into a blooming rose yet,

892
00:33:09,205 --> 00:33:09,804
at least

893
00:33:10,184 --> 00:33:11,865
I'm already an awakened flower.

894
00:33:11,953 --> 00:33:13,594
♪Into gray diamond gems♪

895
00:33:13,844 --> 00:33:14,885
Just give me a chance

896
00:33:14,965 --> 00:33:16,205
to fully awaken.

897
00:33:20,627 --> 00:33:22,332
♪I am nobody's accessory♪

898
00:33:22,764 --> 00:33:23,965
You're the legal counsel.

899
00:33:24,324 --> 00:33:24,925
You decide.

900
00:33:25,337 --> 00:33:26,765
♪I can still pierce the sky♪

901
00:33:26,765 --> 00:33:28,428
♪When all the lights go out♪

902
00:33:28,925 --> 00:33:29,445
Ms. Weng,

903
00:33:30,604 --> 00:33:32,084
back then, you told me firmly,

904
00:33:32,764 --> 00:33:34,245
"Jiao Xu, I believe in you."

905
00:33:34,925 --> 00:33:35,925
Now I'm telling you too,

906
00:33:36,885 --> 00:33:37,284
Ms. Weng,

907
00:33:38,005 --> 00:33:38,630
I believe in you.

908
00:33:38,630 --> 00:33:41,389
♪Wings torn apart by the night♪

909
00:33:41,885 --> 00:33:42,685
Then

910
00:33:43,165 --> 00:33:44,364
let's form

911
00:33:45,084 --> 00:33:47,685
the ultimate Dream Team of Wu Ta.

912
00:33:49,324 --> 00:33:50,324
Dream Team.

913
00:33:50,324 --> 00:33:51,084
Love the name.

914
00:33:51,645 --> 00:33:52,284
Awesome!

915
00:33:52,764 --> 00:33:53,725
Dream Team.

916
00:33:54,564 --> 00:33:55,324
Let's eat.

917
00:34:00,604 --> 00:34:01,205
Zi,

918
00:34:01,604 --> 00:34:02,485
I want some beef.

919
00:34:02,804 --> 00:34:03,964
I'll get you another plate.

920
00:34:06,486 --> 00:34:07,205
It's rare for us

921
00:34:07,205 --> 00:34:08,244
to sit together like this.

922
00:34:09,044 --> 00:34:09,524
Cheers?

923
00:34:10,724 --> 00:34:11,124
Cheers!

924
00:34:17,845 --> 00:34:19,119
You can really drink, Ms. Hui.

925
00:34:19,325 --> 00:34:20,134
Let's do this often.

926
00:34:22,885 --> 00:34:23,724
I'm afraid we can't.

927
00:34:25,524 --> 00:34:26,564
If all goes as planned,

928
00:34:27,044 --> 00:34:27,724
this will be

929
00:34:27,765 --> 00:34:28,724
our last meeting.

930
00:34:32,765 --> 00:34:33,765
You're going abroad?

931
00:34:35,244 --> 00:34:36,684
The trust issue is resolved,

932
00:34:37,365 --> 00:34:38,524
and Han Guang has fallen.

933
00:34:39,724 --> 00:34:40,925
I can finally take Haoyu

934
00:34:41,285 --> 00:34:41,885
with me.

935
00:34:45,084 --> 00:34:45,724
Best of luck.

936
00:34:47,285 --> 00:34:48,084
And I hope you

937
00:34:48,805 --> 00:34:49,885
get to enjoy your beef too.

938
00:34:50,485 --> 00:34:51,365
It's been in there too long.

939
00:34:51,365 --> 00:34:52,445
- I completely forgot.
- It's overcooked.

940
00:34:52,485 --> 00:34:53,325
I forgot. My beef.

941
00:34:53,325 --> 00:34:53,965
(This period)

942
00:34:54,365 --> 00:34:56,164
(where life's mask was stripped away)

943
00:34:56,244 --> 00:34:56,965
(taught me)

944
00:34:57,765 --> 00:34:58,765
(that a good life)

945
00:34:59,244 --> 00:35:00,325
(is never given by anyone,)

946
00:35:00,885 --> 00:35:02,084
(nor should it be.)

947
00:35:02,805 --> 00:35:03,564
(True fortune)

948
00:35:03,965 --> 00:35:05,005
(comes from taking action)

949
00:35:05,365 --> 00:35:06,885
(and holding fate in your own hands.)

950
00:35:21,365 --> 00:35:22,204
Why are you here?

951
00:35:23,084 --> 00:35:24,204
Picking up my son.

952
00:35:25,445 --> 00:35:26,044
You drag him

953
00:35:26,084 --> 00:35:27,124
from place to place.

954
00:35:27,485 --> 00:35:28,662
What kind of life is that?

955
00:35:31,325 --> 00:35:32,325
Haoyu won't go with you.

956
00:35:33,965 --> 00:35:34,564
Don't come back

957
00:35:34,644 --> 00:35:35,564
and disturb our peace.

958
00:35:41,805 --> 00:35:42,445
Let go of me.

959
00:35:43,885 --> 00:35:44,604
Have you forgotten

960
00:35:44,805 --> 00:35:45,965
about the trust?

961
00:35:47,204 --> 00:35:48,485
I gave the trust to Yu Meng.

962
00:35:49,164 --> 00:35:50,465
We agreed to settle peacefully.

963
00:35:51,084 --> 00:35:51,564
This matter

964
00:35:52,005 --> 00:35:52,724
ends here.

965
00:35:53,524 --> 00:35:55,044
You won't get a single cent back.

966
00:35:55,244 --> 00:35:56,285
Are you crazy?

967
00:35:57,861 --> 00:35:58,805
Did you lose your mind

968
00:35:58,965 --> 00:36:00,084
to do something so stupid?

969
00:36:00,965 --> 00:36:02,244
Do you think this is charity?

970
00:36:02,604 --> 00:36:03,925
I don't want to drag this on.

971
00:36:05,325 --> 00:36:06,564
I think it's the best outcome

972
00:36:06,885 --> 00:36:07,765
for both of us.

973
00:36:08,124 --> 00:36:09,005
Then what about me?

974
00:36:11,405 --> 00:36:12,564
Back then, to save our son,

975
00:36:13,325 --> 00:36:15,014
I gave up my pride
as a live-in son-in-law,

976
00:36:15,084 --> 00:36:16,244
waiting on that whole family.

977
00:36:16,684 --> 00:36:18,084
I've groveled for all these years,

978
00:36:18,564 --> 00:36:19,485
being like a dog

979
00:36:19,485 --> 00:36:20,564
ordered around by them.

980
00:36:20,724 --> 00:36:21,445
And in the end,

981
00:36:22,204 --> 00:36:23,436
I got nothing on either side.

982
00:36:23,684 --> 00:36:24,564
Now my ex-wife

983
00:36:24,564 --> 00:36:25,402
and my current wife

984
00:36:25,604 --> 00:36:26,445
are in cahoots,

985
00:36:26,445 --> 00:36:27,365
teaming up against me.

986
00:36:28,765 --> 00:36:30,084
Are you playing me for a fool?

987
00:36:30,805 --> 00:36:32,285
Don't make yourself sound so noble.

988
00:36:33,765 --> 00:36:34,885
Ask yourself:

989
00:36:35,845 --> 00:36:37,084
How many times did I beg you

990
00:36:37,365 --> 00:36:38,084
to stop?

991
00:36:39,044 --> 00:36:40,204
You've been too greedy,

992
00:36:40,445 --> 00:36:41,845
lying to me again and again,

993
00:36:42,005 --> 00:36:43,325
dug your own grave step by step.

994
00:36:43,965 --> 00:36:44,608
Who's to blame?

995
00:36:45,365 --> 00:36:46,489
You threw the chances away

996
00:36:46,524 --> 00:36:47,564
with your own hands.

997
00:36:48,485 --> 00:36:49,005
Fine.

998
00:36:50,485 --> 00:36:51,325
Blame it all on me.

999
00:36:53,005 --> 00:36:54,524
Burning bridges like this

1000
00:36:55,325 --> 00:36:56,524
and playing it so well.

1001
00:36:56,845 --> 00:36:58,325
I lost my chairman seat

1002
00:36:58,765 --> 00:36:59,765
and lost the trust.

1003
00:37:00,204 --> 00:37:01,204
Han Guang fell,

1004
00:37:01,684 --> 00:37:02,965
and the Weng family gave

1005
00:37:03,325 --> 00:37:04,885
his Jiali shares back to Yu Meng

1006
00:37:05,124 --> 00:37:06,084
as a favor.

1007
00:37:06,524 --> 00:37:07,204
Now Jiali

1008
00:37:07,285 --> 00:37:08,485
has nothing to do with me.

1009
00:37:08,485 --> 00:37:09,604
I have nothing left.

1010
00:37:13,925 --> 00:37:14,965
It's all your fault.

1011
00:37:17,005 --> 00:37:17,805
You were the one

1012
00:37:17,925 --> 00:37:19,124
who pushed me to Yu Meng.

1013
00:37:25,524 --> 00:37:26,164
Blame me.

1014
00:37:27,445 --> 00:37:27,965
Fault me.

1015
00:37:29,925 --> 00:37:30,765
Whatever.

1016
00:37:31,485 --> 00:37:33,244
Because I gave up on you long ago.

1017
00:37:33,805 --> 00:37:34,644
Since we despise

1018
00:37:34,644 --> 00:37:36,005
each other so much,

1019
00:37:37,885 --> 00:37:39,285
why stay tied together?

1020
00:37:42,965 --> 00:37:44,124
Here are your documents.

1021
00:37:44,684 --> 00:37:45,794
I've meant to return them.

1022
00:37:46,104 --> 00:37:47,485
Your clothes, shoes, and larger items

1023
00:37:47,485 --> 00:37:48,562
have been shipped to you.

1024
00:37:52,445 --> 00:37:54,044
Are you really going to be this cold?

1025
00:37:57,325 --> 00:37:57,925
I'm exhausted.

1026
00:38:00,325 --> 00:38:01,724
I'm done dealing with you.

1027
00:38:02,604 --> 00:38:03,445
I want nothing

1028
00:38:03,524 --> 00:38:05,005
of you around me.

1029
00:38:06,485 --> 00:38:07,005
You and I

1030
00:38:09,485 --> 00:38:10,204
go separate ways.

1031
00:38:12,604 --> 00:38:13,357
What about Haoyu?

1032
00:38:13,965 --> 00:38:14,757
What does he think?

1033
00:38:16,485 --> 00:38:17,684
I'll explain it to him.

1034
00:38:18,204 --> 00:38:19,485
If you still care about him,

1035
00:38:20,044 --> 00:38:21,005
stop causing him

1036
00:38:21,044 --> 00:38:21,765
any more distress.

1037
00:38:30,084 --> 00:38:30,805
(Come home, son.)

1038
00:38:31,675 --> 00:38:33,161
(I'll do as you say about the trust)

1039
00:38:33,724 --> 00:38:34,365
(and let it go.)

1040
00:38:35,124 --> 00:38:35,961
(I want to see you.)

1041
00:38:37,204 --> 00:38:37,564
Mom.

1042
00:38:39,644 --> 00:38:40,005
Hurry.

1043
00:38:40,405 --> 00:38:40,885
Try this.

1044
00:38:41,636 --> 00:38:42,684
I waited two hours in line

1045
00:38:42,684 --> 00:38:43,044
for this.

1046
00:38:43,285 --> 00:38:44,684
Young girls are all into this now.

1047
00:38:45,285 --> 00:38:46,805
I'm old. I'm no young girl.

1048
00:38:47,684 --> 00:38:48,325
Says who?

1049
00:38:49,724 --> 00:38:50,925
When we go out together,

1050
00:38:51,084 --> 00:38:52,131
they think we're siblings.

1051
00:38:52,485 --> 00:38:53,644
How are you not a young girl?

1052
00:38:53,644 --> 00:38:54,124
All right.

1053
00:38:54,845 --> 00:38:55,805
Stop teasing me.

1054
00:38:57,164 --> 00:38:57,524
Mom,

1055
00:38:58,925 --> 00:38:59,485
I'm sorry.

1056
00:39:00,044 --> 00:39:00,684
I shouldn't

1057
00:39:01,164 --> 00:39:01,965
have fought you.

1058
00:39:02,965 --> 00:39:03,823
It's not your fault.

1059
00:39:04,244 --> 00:39:05,604
I was too emotional that day.

1060
00:39:07,044 --> 00:39:07,885
About the trust,

1061
00:39:09,044 --> 00:39:10,204
I respect your decision.

1062
00:39:11,124 --> 00:39:11,564
Really?

1063
00:39:12,445 --> 00:39:12,805
Then

1064
00:39:13,845 --> 00:39:14,604
did Dad agree too?

1065
00:39:17,005 --> 00:39:17,965
It's basically settled.

1066
00:39:20,204 --> 00:39:21,044
As for your dad,

1067
00:39:22,524 --> 00:39:23,485
I plan to leave him

1068
00:39:24,564 --> 00:39:25,365
and cut all contact.

1069
00:39:30,765 --> 00:39:32,044
Is it because of the trust?

1070
00:39:34,684 --> 00:39:36,124
Our personalities clash.

1071
00:39:37,084 --> 00:39:37,644
Together,

1072
00:39:37,684 --> 00:39:38,604
we irritate each other.

1073
00:39:38,965 --> 00:39:39,845
Better to split.

1074
00:39:40,445 --> 00:39:41,325
Can you accept that?

1075
00:39:42,405 --> 00:39:43,244
I'm an adult.

1076
00:39:44,044 --> 00:39:45,005
I don't have to choose

1077
00:39:45,451 --> 00:39:45,925
between Dad

1078
00:39:45,925 --> 00:39:46,925
and Mom.

1079
00:39:48,005 --> 00:39:49,005
Of course I can.

1080
00:39:50,044 --> 00:39:51,244
I respect what you two decide.

1081
00:39:51,885 --> 00:39:52,285
But

1082
00:39:53,564 --> 00:39:54,524
I can still live

1083
00:39:54,524 --> 00:39:55,204
with you, right?

1084
00:39:55,805 --> 00:39:56,724
You're my son.

1085
00:39:57,684 --> 00:39:59,204
Who else would you live with?

1086
00:40:01,124 --> 00:40:02,244
And about the trust,

1087
00:40:03,485 --> 00:40:04,405
don't blame your dad

1088
00:40:04,684 --> 00:40:05,684
or hold it against him.

1089
00:40:08,044 --> 00:40:08,925
He loves you very much

1090
00:40:09,925 --> 00:40:11,445
and is a wonderful father.

1091
00:40:12,555 --> 00:40:13,244
Don't cut him off

1092
00:40:13,244 --> 00:40:14,325
just because I stopped

1093
00:40:15,084 --> 00:40:15,925
seeing him.

1094
00:40:16,845 --> 00:40:18,604
I just don't know how to face him

1095
00:40:19,765 --> 00:40:20,845
for now.

1096
00:40:22,164 --> 00:40:23,805
I need some time.

1097
00:40:26,445 --> 00:40:26,845
Mom,

1098
00:40:27,644 --> 00:40:28,325
drink it before

1099
00:40:28,564 --> 00:40:29,206
it gets cold.

1100
00:40:30,990 --> 00:40:31,928
(Passport)

1101
00:40:33,485 --> 00:40:34,124
I've decided

1102
00:40:34,885 --> 00:40:35,885
to go abroad with you.

1103
00:40:38,204 --> 00:40:39,084
That's great.

1104
00:40:39,965 --> 00:40:40,765
Why suddenly

1105
00:40:41,285 --> 00:40:42,044
so obedient

1106
00:40:42,044 --> 00:40:42,925
and willing to come?

1107
00:40:44,285 --> 00:40:45,885
Well, you are my mom.

1108
00:40:46,005 --> 00:40:46,840
Of course, I listen

1109
00:40:47,204 --> 00:40:47,684
to you.

1110
00:40:52,601 --> 00:40:54,903
=The Vanishing Beauty=
(Next Episode Preview)

1111
00:40:55,405 --> 00:40:56,204
I'm looking

1112
00:40:56,204 --> 00:40:57,485
for Di Liren, the chairman

1113
00:40:57,485 --> 00:40:58,164
of Jiali Cosmetics.

1114
00:40:58,164 --> 00:40:59,325
Let me up right now.

1115
00:40:59,325 --> 00:40:59,845
Sir,

1116
00:40:59,845 --> 00:41:00,965
it's building policy.

1117
00:41:01,084 --> 00:41:02,485
You'll need an employee badge

1118
00:41:02,485 --> 00:41:03,564
or an invitation code to go up.

1119
00:41:03,564 --> 00:41:04,044
Hello.

1120
00:41:04,325 --> 00:41:05,765
We're from Wuyou Moving Company.

1121
00:41:06,445 --> 00:41:07,244
Let me see Haoyu.

1122
00:41:08,285 --> 00:41:08,965
Are you worthy?

1123
00:41:09,524 --> 00:41:10,365
I'm his father.

1124
00:41:10,485 --> 00:41:11,885
If I weren't out of cash,

1125
00:41:12,485 --> 00:41:13,365
I wouldn't be

1126
00:41:13,365 --> 00:41:14,457
disturbing you, Mr. Busy.

1127
00:41:15,124 --> 00:41:15,644
But I don't

1128
00:41:15,644 --> 00:41:16,786
want to give you money now.

1129
00:41:17,124 --> 00:41:18,564
I won't support a gambling addict.

1130
00:41:19,204 --> 00:41:19,845
All right.

1131
00:41:20,445 --> 00:41:21,845
Then I'll go talk to Lu Hui.

1132
00:41:22,684 --> 00:41:23,524
We can talk

1133
00:41:23,564 --> 00:41:25,244
about how her father, Lu Zhiming, died.

1134
00:41:40,618 --> 00:41:45,487
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1135
00:41:47,971 --> 00:41:52,834
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1136
00:41:55,292 --> 00:42:00,137
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1137
00:42:00,582 --> 00:42:07,084
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1138
00:42:09,816 --> 00:42:16,769
♪I write the future into a song,
honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1139
00:42:17,319 --> 00:42:23,249
♪Turning all losses
into the passion of this moment♪

1140
00:42:24,373 --> 00:42:31,604
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1141
00:42:31,907 --> 00:42:37,080
♪Forging all weaknesses
into sharp, bold colors♪

1142
00:42:37,700 --> 00:42:49,168
♪In this life,
I follow only my own choice♪

1143
00:42:51,668 --> 00:42:56,916
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1144
00:42:58,957 --> 00:43:04,392
♪No need to echo those
who drifted apart♪

1145
00:43:06,214 --> 00:43:11,611
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1146
00:43:11,611 --> 00:43:20,256
♪The answer has long been etched
in my silhouette♪

1147
00:43:20,732 --> 00:43:28,295
♪I write the future into a song,
for the me who never walks away♪

1148
00:43:28,295 --> 00:43:34,141
♪Paving every twist and turn
into a path forward♪

1149
00:43:34,141 --> 00:43:44,308
♪The ending of this life
will be set by me♪

